  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Fund: Science, Technology &amp; Cybersecurity Diplomacy Mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to capacitate stakeholders through different policy engagements towards the development of the science, technology, and innovation (STI) ecosystem in Nigeria as well as strengthen the ecosystem capacity for increased investment inflow. Specifically, the project will:
i.	Analyse existing policy and regulatory framework(s) in Nigeria&#x2019;s STI ecosystem.
ii.	Conduct stakeholders needs assessment on the STI policy and regulatory ecosystem in Nigeria.
iii.	Build institutional capacity to support policy and regulation of emerging technologies such as artificial intelligence in Nigeria&#x2019;s STI ecosystem.
iv.	Facilitate policy dialogue sessions among government MDAs, organized private sector and development organizations within Nigeria&#x2019;s STI ecosystem.</narrative>
  </description>
